  "body": "<div id=\"editions\"><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Alex Antoniou</div><div id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"grc\">  <div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  <a id=\"al1-interpretive\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Ἀριστίωνος\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Ἀριστίωνος\">Ἀρ̣ι̣στίων<span class=\"error\" title=\"hi tag with rend=stacked is not supported!\">ο</span>ς</span></span>  </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Alex Antoniou</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"grc\"><div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><a id=\"al1-diplomatic\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Ἀριστίωνος\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Ἀριστίωνος\">Α..ΣΤΙΩΝ<span class=\"error\" title=\"hi tag with rend=stacked is not supported!\">Ο</span>Σ</span></span></span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div></div>  <div id=\"facsimile-images\"><h2>Facsimile Images</h2></div>  <div id=\"apparatus\"><h4>Apparatus criticus</h4><ul><li><span><span>text of Meligunìs Lipára XII with minor amendment from photograph</span></span></li></ul></div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2> translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\">  </p><p>  </p></div>  <div id=\"commentary\"><h2>commentary</h2>  <p>the final sigma is placed under the preceding letter, due to lack of space. Traces of both the initial rho and iota are visible</p>  </div>  <div id=\"bibliography\"><h2>bibliography</h2>  <ul><li></li><li>   Bernabó-Brea  Cavalier  Campagna  2003 14 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000541\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000541</a></li></ul>  <ul><li></li></ul>  </div>  <div id=\"handnote\"><p>small omicron and omega</p> Line 1  55-65  Interlineation line 1 to 2  NA  </div><div id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence. </div>",
